{"id":"de1cd2013aed2d29","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-halting-set-nonrecursive.md","title":"73-thm-halting-set-nonrecursive — halting set nonrecursive","display":"73-thm-halting-set-nonrecursive — halting set nonrecursive","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-halting-set-nonrecursive","display":"73-thm-halting-set-nonrecursive — halting set nonrecursive","depends_on":["[[73-df-typed-halting-set-notations]]","[[73-df-recursive-language-notation]]","[[73-df-numeric-program-interface]]","[[73-thm-binary-halting-undecidability]]"],"aliases":["73-thm-halting-set-nonrecursive","73-theorem-5.1"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-halting-set-nonrecursive"},{"key":"display","html":"73-thm-halting-set-nonrecursive — halting set nonrecursive"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"86e3771995bb6290\" href=\"?note=86e3771995bb6290\" title=\"73-df-typed-halting-set-notations\">73-df-typed-halting-set-notations</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"285f46d94947b99e\" href=\"?note=285f46d94947b99e\" title=\"73-df-recursive-language-notation\">73-df-recursive-language-notation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"219767ec839d8c84\" href=\"?note=219767ec839d8c84\" title=\"73-df-numeric-program-interface\">73-df-numeric-program-interface</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b1b899d5ae3caf58\" href=\"?note=b1b899d5ae3caf58\" title=\"73-thm-binary-halting-undecidability\">73-thm-binary-halting-undecidability</a></span></div>"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-halting-set-nonrecursive</span><span>73-theorem-5.1</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"86e3771995bb6290\" href=\"?note=86e3771995bb6290\" title=\"73-df-typed-halting-set-notations\">73-df-typed-halting-set-notations</a> 的固定角色 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\in\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\kappa\\in\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa=0\">\\(\\kappa=0\\)</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RECURSIVE}\">\\(\\mathrm{RECURSIVE}\\)</span> 指 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"219767ec839d8c84\" href=\"?note=219767ec839d8c84\" title=\"73-df-numeric-program-interface\">73-df-numeric-program-interface</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RECURSIVE}_{\\mathbb N}\">\\(\\mathrm{RECURSIVE}_{\\mathbb N}\\)</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa=1\">\\(\\kappa=1\\)</span> 时指 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"285f46d94947b99e\" href=\"?note=285f46d94947b99e\" title=\"73-df-recursive-language-notation\">73-df-recursive-language-notation</a> 的二进制词语言实例。</li>\n<li>同一断言是两个有类型的实例，不把自然数集与词语言放入错误载体的类。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}5.1}\\vdash\nK\\notin\\mathrm{RECURSIVE}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}5.1}\\vdash\nK\\notin\\mathrm{RECURSIVE}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>数值对角版本由停机判定的对角反证得到；配对版本可有效编译数值输入与固定程序而得到不可判定性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-typed-halting-set-notations","status":"resolved","id":"86e3771995bb6290","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-typed-halting-set-notations]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-recursive-language-notation","status":"resolved","id":"285f46d94947b99e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-recursive-language-notation]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-numeric-program-interface","status":"resolved","id":"219767ec839d8c84","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-numeric-program-interface]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-binary-halting-undecidability","status":"resolved","id":"b1b899d5ae3caf58","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-thm-binary-halting-undecidability]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-typed-halting-set-notations","status":"resolved","id":"86e3771995bb6290","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$K$ 使用 [[73-df-typed-halting-set-notations]] 的固定角色 $\\kappa\\in\\{0,1\\}$；当 $\\kappa=0$ 时，$\\mathrm{RECURSIVE}$ 指 [[73-df-numeric-program-interface]] 的 $\\mathrm{RECURSIVE}_{\\mathbb N}$；当 $\\kappa=1$ 时指 [[73-df-recursive-language-notation]] 的二进制词语言实例。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-numeric-program-interface","status":"resolved","id":"219767ec839d8c84","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$K$ 使用 [[73-df-typed-halting-set-notations]] 的固定角色 $\\kappa\\in\\{0,1\\}$；当 $\\kappa=0$ 时，$\\mathrm{RECURSIVE}$ 指 [[73-df-numeric-program-interface]] 的 $\\mathrm{RECURSIVE}_{\\mathbb N}$；当 $\\kappa=1$ 时指 [[73-df-recursive-language-notation]] 的二进制词语言实例。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-recursive-language-notation","status":"resolved","id":"285f46d94947b99e","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$K$ 使用 [[73-df-typed-halting-set-notations]] 的固定角色 $\\kappa\\in\\{0,1\\}$；当 $\\kappa=0$ 时，$\\mathrm{RECURSIVE}$ 指 [[73-df-numeric-program-interface]] 的 $\\mathrm{RECURSIVE}_{\\mathbb N}$；当 $\\kappa=1$ 时指 [[73-df-recursive-language-notation]] 的二进制词语言实例。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa\\in\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RECURSIVE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RECURSIVE}_{\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa=1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}5.1}\\vdash\nK\\notin\\mathrm{RECURSIVE}","display":true}],"bytes":1171,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["86e3771995bb6290","285f46d94947b99e","219767ec839d8c84","b1b899d5ae3caf58"]}